                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "721548b6-df16-343c-a931-8fd8977da541",
                        "entry_id": "619310ba-a34b-3e7e-8346-da8d049c80f3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een probleem vormend; een probleem veroorzakend"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "16352468-7164-4f04-bb76-945867ecf492",
                                "sense_id": "721548b6-df16-343c-a931-8fd8977da541",
                                "text": "Dit maakt het een nog problematischere aangelegenheid."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1cab41a9-ef18-4d84-bafc-735d29217f3e",
                                "sense_id": "721548b6-df16-343c-a931-8fd8977da541",
                                "text": "Of het nu van links of van rechts komt, het basisuitgangspunt is dat bevolkingsgroei inherent problematischis, en bij voorkeur vermeden moet worden. Maar klopt dat wel? Een blik op de wereld en haar geschiedenis doet eerder het tegenovergestelde vermoeden. De afgelopen anderhalve eeuw groeide de wereldbevolking van 1,6 naar 7 miljard zielen, maar in plaats van dat het slechter ging, werden we in die tijd welvarender, beter gevoed, gezonder, geletterder en gelukkiger. Zou het kunnen dat een groeiende bevolking meer problemen oplost dan ze creëert, en dat bevolkingsgroei in Afrika juist welkom is? En wat betekent die groei voor het klimaat?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9d78e484-64f4-40ef-ba94-74bd35298c9f",
                        "source_entry_id": "619310ba-a34b-3e7e-8346-da8d049c80f3",
                        "source_sense_id": "721548b6-df16-343c-a931-8fd8977da541",
                        "source_sense_description": "een probleem vormend",
                        "target_lang_word": "problematisch",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "problematisch",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "952f9cc1-2465-3413-a9fe-253522de4ea0",
                                        "entry_id": "1adeec69-189f-3b9f-920c-e0e7595fafb3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "mit Problemen verbunden; so, dass Schwierigkeiten auftreten können"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f7cb7ae-6b7f-41ad-8ce1-d414fd40306d",
                                                "sense_id": "952f9cc1-2465-3413-a9fe-253522de4ea0",
                                                "text": "Die Entsorgung von Batterien über den Hausmüll ist problematisch, weil die Batterien giftige Stoffe enthalten, die austreten können."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33c080d6-f86e-4aa7-b3c9-cd3840ad97eb",
                                                "sense_id": "952f9cc1-2465-3413-a9fe-253522de4ea0",
                                                "text": "„Sie spricht von einer Sinnkrise, die ebenso problematisch sei wie die Wirtschaftskrise.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "70468453-1ab9-4d6e-b614-538c703294cc",
                        "source_entry_id": "619310ba-a34b-3e7e-8346-da8d049c80f3",
                        "source_sense_id": "721548b6-df16-343c-a931-8fd8977da541",
                        "source_sense_description": "een probleem vormend",
                        "target_lang_word": "problematic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "problematic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "412df64a-41dd-3cc0-a03b-c52cee05544e",
                                        "entry_id": "ef635a35-a06d-3232-8878-f76bcd96efea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Posing a problem; having or suffering from problem(s):",
                                            "Difficult to overcome, solve, or decide."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cacade07-3d86-45c6-adb6-83e60cfccd11",
                                                "sense_id": "412df64a-41dd-3cc0-a03b-c52cee05544e",
                                                "text": "And the most problematic thing of all is that it is impossible for me even to know and tell you their names, unless one of them happens to be a playwright."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "102507ef-f7ee-45ae-88e1-58caaa2202d7",
                                                "sense_id": "412df64a-41dd-3cc0-a03b-c52cee05544e",
                                                "text": "However, estimating what consumers will pay in the future is problematic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9f4a386-e528-478e-a58c-5b66141a9c62",
                                                "sense_id": "412df64a-41dd-3cc0-a03b-c52cee05544e",
                                                "text": "The station is blessed with a cafe and staff accommodation, as it's an important crew changeover point, although this can be problematic when services are late."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3cda71e-44fa-3364-8bd6-b3fdd7cc55cd",
                                        "entry_id": "ef635a35-a06d-3232-8878-f76bcd96efea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Posing a problem; having or suffering from problem(s):",
                                            "Not settled, uncertain, of uncertain outcome; debatable, questionable, open to doubt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a51541d0-dd5e-4e74-b2a5-1bcb72b7325e",
                                                "sense_id": "f3cda71e-44fa-3364-8bd6-b3fdd7cc55cd",
                                                "text": "The strangeness of hiring undocumented Mexican women as domestics, many of whom were no older than fifteen, seemed strange to me. It was this strangeness that raised the topic of domestic service as a question and made problematic what had previously been taken for granted."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c87de93d-dd74-4d95-8951-07d09168e997",
                                                "sense_id": "f3cda71e-44fa-3364-8bd6-b3fdd7cc55cd",
                                                "text": "a problematic analysis"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e610a5c9-189a-488e-8a17-bbcdd8eb85d6",
                                                "sense_id": "f3cda71e-44fa-3364-8bd6-b3fdd7cc55cd",
                                                "text": "it portends a problematic future for the movement"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13cfb944-63d8-3eb6-90c6-ea6fe483f74d",
                                        "entry_id": "ef635a35-a06d-3232-8878-f76bcd96efea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Posing a problem; having or suffering from problem(s):",
                                            "Contributing (especially if subtly) to discrimination (such as racism, sexism, homophobia, transphobia, or ageism)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3409ac41-7c8b-38cf-bb10-10d1915d49d4",
                                        "entry_id": "ef635a35-a06d-3232-8878-f76bcd96efea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Only affirming the possibility that a predicate be actualised."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "problematic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c8d96a7-e393-36e2-9a42-66b2e07e887c",
                                        "entry_id": "c1e90292-9b08-371a-9e58-3b7144e999f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A problem or difficulty in a particular field of study."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78ad34bf-6c54-4e92-9160-7f8b23535387",
                                                "sense_id": "7c8d96a7-e393-36e2-9a42-66b2e07e887c",
                                                "text": "The seemingly intractable problematic of essentialism versus antiessentialism and primordialism versus circumstantialism endemic to identity analysis today."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17aec5c7-2c8a-4229-be0f-d0cda9291416",
                                                "sense_id": "7c8d96a7-e393-36e2-9a42-66b2e07e887c",
                                                "text": "However, for those who come to India’s railway history for the first time, perhaps via knowledge of other countries’ railway histories with which they want to make India-based comparisons or in pursuit of a particular problematic—for example the role of railways in economic development—this chapter may prove useful."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
